"An asset bought on an account of this analytic plan records it as 'Funded "
"by'. Its depreciation and disposal entries never carry it, so the fund is "
"charged once, at purchase."
msgstr ""
"إذا اشتُري أصل على حساب من هذه الخطة التحليلية، سُجّل ذلك الحساب في «مموّل "
